  "id":"tx-pu-math-contest-v2-ch1-1.1-ex-03","subject":"math","l2":"函数极限与连续","l3_id":"math.calc.limit.compute","atom_id":"","book_id":"","ability_goal":"construct","item_form":"blank","difficulty":"hit","question":"设 $F(x)$ 除 $x=0$ 与1两点外，对全体实数都有定义并且满足 $F(x)+F((x-1)/x)=1+x$，求函数 $F(x)$." ,"answer":"$F(x)=\\frac{x^3-x^2-1}{2x(x-1)}$.","ref_source":"textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2","techniques":["函数复合","函数方程"],"solution":{"steps":[{"id":"s1","text":"分析 将所给等式视为未知函数的一个方程，变量代换得到新的方程后解方程组."},{"id":"s2","text":"将原式中的 $x$ 换为 $(x-1)/x$."},{"id":"s3","text":"F((x-1)/x)+F(-1/(x-1))=(2x-1)/x$."},{"id":"s4","text":"再将 $-1/(x-1)$ 换成 $x$."},{"id":"s5","text":"F(-1/(x-1))+F(x)=(x-2)/(x-1)$."},{"id":"s6","text":"原式与上式线性组合得."},{"id":"s7","text":"$2F(x)=1+x+(x-2)/(x-1)-(2x-1)/x$."}],"final_answer":"$F(x)=\\frac{x^3-x^2-1}{2x(x-1)}$.","techniques_used":["函数复合","函数方程"]},"cdps":[{"id":"c1","prompt":"外层/内层函数的定义域分段如何决定复合后的区间划分？","technique":"函数复合","expected":"先按外层分段条件反解内层，得到自变量区间，再代入对应表达式。"},{"id":"c2","prompt":"最终显式表达式（或所求对象）的关键结构是什么？","technique":"函数方程","expected":"$F(x)=\\frac{x^3-x^2-1}{2x(x-1)}$."}],"meta":{"source":"textbook_example","book_id":"puheping_math_contest_v2","book_title":"","book_author":"蒲和平","chapter":"","section":"1.1","example_id":"例3","page":9,"quality_basis":"source_textbook_worked_example"}}
